# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:3
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_f7213481:

    # "Markus’ house was only slightly smaller than mine but felt much more cramped."
    "마커스의 집은 내 집보다 살짝 작았지만 훨씬 더 비좁게 느껴졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:4
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_8d7cfe15:

    # "Littered about the place were various strange and extraordinary items his brother had collected over the years that clogged up much of the space, hence why me and Markus spent less time here growing up."
    "장소 여기저기에는 그의 형이 여러 해에 걸쳐 수집한 다양하고 기이하며 놀라운 물건들이 흩어져 있어 공간 대부분을 막고 있었다. 그래서 나와 마커스가 자라면서 여기서 보내는 시간이 적었던 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:9
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_209c6d2f:

    # "Entering through a door open ajar, I've realized that I walked into what could be described as a family conversation:"
    "살짝 열린 문을 통해 들어서자, 나는 이게 가족 간의 대화라고 할 만한 자리에 걸어 들어왔음을 깨달았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:11
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_340883f3:

    # "It was Skallion, Markus' brother."
    "마커스의 형제인 스칼리온이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:12
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_d6aaf9ed:

    # "Having lost both of his parents during the war, Skallion, who used to live alone, was forced to take the young Markus under his wing."
    "전쟁 중 부모를 모두 잃은, 혼자 살던 스칼리온은 어린 마커스를 자신의 날개 아래 받아들일 수밖에 없었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:13
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_00a28245:

    # "He was taller and more muscular than both of us has been before we joined the Scouts, but now we towered over him."
    "우리가 정찰대에 들어가기 전보다 훨씬 크고 근육질이 됐지만, 이제 우리가 그를 내려다보게 됐다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:15
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_ba816de9:

    # SKALLION "What I'm saying is, Markus..."
    SKALLION "내 말은 말이지, 마커스..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:17
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_447fd455:

    # SKALLION "Bah!"
    SKALLION "바!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:18
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_fbc49fa5:

    # SKALLION "Not you too!"
    SKALLION "너마저!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr03.rpy:19
translate kr qst_FromAnotherWorld_GoToMarkusHouse_16665f31:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS          "[player_name!t]!"

